Package: libmutter-14-0
Version: @DEB_MUTTER_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-4-1, libgraphene-1.0-0, libpango-1.0-0, libcairo2, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0, libjson-glib-1.0-0, liblcms2-2, libcolord2, libxkbcommon0, libpixman-1-0, libwayland0, angle (>= 2.1.0+git20260630.a32d31d+es3-14), libei1, libatk1.0-0
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Description: window manager library from the Mutter window manager
 Mutter is a window and compositing manager based on Clutter and bundling its
 own copies of Cogl (a GL/GLES abstraction) and Clutter (a scene graph). It is
 the GNOME Shell compositor.
 .
 This package contains the shared libraries libmutter-14, libmutter-clutter-14,
 libmutter-cogl-14, libmutter-cogl-pango-14 and libmutter-mtk-14, plus Mutter's
 plugin and typelib data directory. This build targets iOS as a Wayland
 compositor over ANGLE/EGL (no native KMS/DRM/logind backend); the IOSurface
 display backend is provided separately.
